{
  "key": "sound/kit-synthpop-linndrum",
  "kind": "sound",
  "summary": "LinnDrum kit for 80s synth-pop and synthwave: tight kick, snare, hats, clap, sidestick, tambourine",
  "tags": [
    "synth-pop",
    "synthpop",
    "synthwave",
    "80s",
    "LinnDrum",
    "Linn",
    "pop",
    "kit",
    "drums",
    "retro"
  ],
  "devices": [
    "Playfield"
  ],
  "links": [
    "genre/synth-pop",
    "genre/synthwave"
  ],
  "checked": {
    "how": "written",
    "by": "claude (style kits)",
    "date": "2026-11-24",
    "opendaw": "652e6ca"
  },
  "body": [
    "The LinnDrum, the 80s pop drum machine. A big reverb on the snare (gated in synthwave) does most of the period sound.",
    "Apply makes a new drum track (it never replaces the old one): park the old drums (mute) at the bar the new kit starts. Pads are named by role, so drum patterns and evolve_notes find them; samples (the tool) finds other sounds to swap in with make_kit."
  ],
  "apply": {
    "params": {
      "pattern": {
        "type": "text",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "a knowledge drum pattern for it to play from the start (\"pattern/trap-2bar\"); leave out for an empty kit"
      },
      "from_bar": {
        "type": "number",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "the timeline bar its region starts on (loop off: the next bar line after it lands)"
      },
      "bars": {
        "type": "number",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "how many bars it runs (loop off: to the song's end)"
      },
      "name": {
        "type": "text",
        "optional": true
      }
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "op": "kit",
        "input": {
          "name": "$name",
          "default_name": "Linn Kit",
          "volume_db": -3,
          "pads": [
            {
              "role": "kick",
              "sample": "LinnDrum/bd/Bassdrum"
            },
            {
              "role": "snare",
              "sample": "LinnDrum/sd/0Snarderum-01"
            },
            {
              "role": "closed_hat",
              "sample": "LinnDrum/hh/Hat Closed-01"
            },
            {
              "role": "open_hat",
              "sample": "LinnDrum/oh/Hat Open"
            },
            {
              "role": "clap",
              "sample": "LinnDrum/cp/Clap"
            },
            {
              "role": "rim",
              "sample": "LinnDrum/rim/Sidestick-01"
            },
            {
              "role": "shaker",
              "sample": "LinnDrum/tb/Tambourine"
            },
            {
              "role": "crash",
              "sample": "LinnDrum/cr/Crash"
            }
          ],
          "notes": {
            "of": "$pattern",
            "from_bar": "$from_bar",
            "bars": "$bars"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
